! HF 6-31G(d) Freq pal16
%freq 
  QuasiRRHO true
  QRRHORefFreq    200 # in cm-1
end
%maxcore 6000

# Water HF/6-31G(d) freq with quasi-RRHO with a QHRRO-cutoff frequency 200 cm-1
# NB Orca terminology refers to reference frequency, whereas cutoff is used to (hopefully) exclude translations and rotations from the partition function
# This will happen if translation-rotation projection (PROJECTTR) is on (default)

* xyz 0 1
O   0.000000   0.000000   0.117176
H   0.000000   0.757601  -0.468704
H   0.000000  -0.757601  -0.468704
*
